{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>NOTE: This DLC is primarily for our fellow dwarves who wish to support The Mermaid MenZ developer's small team to continue supporting Bronzebeard's Tavern and support their future game titles!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The depths have overflown into Bronzebeard's Tavern!\u00a0\ud83c\udf0a</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The tide has turned, and the tavern\u2019s gone totally nautical! Dive into the deep with a wave of bubbly new cosmetics and an oceanic tavern theme that transforms your cozy hall into a seaside sanctuary. Whether you're rocking snorkels or ruling the waves in a crown of coral, it\u2019s time to soak up the fun in true dwarven style!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Seaworld Theme Pack Content \ud83e\udd9e</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1x Permanent Tavern Theme\u00a0</strong>-</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kelpbeard's Cove Tavern Theme</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique Customer Skins for:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Goblins, Dwarves, Ophidians and Halflings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Gobbler, Dwarf King, Elder Ophidian &amp; Druid\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>x5 Exclusive Skins</strong> -</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 x Fish Mascot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 x Hearthguard Drip (Red &amp; Yellow)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 x Jellyknit Threads (Pink &amp; Blue)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>x10 Exclusive Cosmetics</strong> -</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hearthguard Cap (Red &amp; Yellow)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hearthguard Bucket (Red &amp; Yellow)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jellyfknit Cap (Pink &amp; Blue)\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">